An invalid table count keeps native header cells in the body

```
{header-rows=7}
|= a |
| b |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">a</th></tr>
    <tr><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
{header-rows=x}
|= a |= b |
| c | d |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">a</th><th scope="row">b</th></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td><td>d</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
{header-rows=1 footer-rows=2}
|= a |
| b |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="row">a</th></tr>
    <tr><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
